00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.610
They're the fruits of her hard work.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.790
Good work today.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:48.750
Oh, Chan-Mari!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.040
It's Tsubasa.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.420
Oh, that's right. Orry-say.

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:55.000
Come, have a seat. Let's share a drink.

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:00.300
Did you capture it?

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:03.930
Just as you requested, Chan-Tsuba.

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:04.510
Here.

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:09.350
Those two have quite the glow, don't they?

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:12.690
The sun's still out, but the Kirara's so bright.

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:16.110
I knew I was right to ask you.

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:19.690
This radiance can only be captured by one who glows just as bright.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:26.280
One such as you, the former Minegishi Minami the 5th and a Center Nova.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.790
I'm no Center Nova.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:33.080
I ran away, after all.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:36.710
But I'll tell you this much.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:45.260
If you want to bring back the Center Nova,
I will do everything in my power to stop you.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.390
Mii-chan, please tell me.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:56.520
What did you and the other Center Novae see?

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:00.940
Thanks for the drink.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:01.860
Will that be on your tab?

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:05.610
She's paying for me. Anks-thay!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:06.820
Certainly, ma'am.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.540
Acchan...

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:15.250
I still haven't found it.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:37.560
<i>I don't know if I've been chosen by the Kirara or anything.</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:42.070
Chieri. You know,

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:49.030
I really don't think it's about winning or losing.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:55.290
I refuse to believe it.

00:23:45.660 --> 00:23:47.160
On Lancastar?

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:48.900
An understudy performance?

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:50.620
I can't do it!

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:54.100
You're always gazing straight ahead, so you can't tell.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:56.530
They're awaiting the second coming of the miracle

00:23:56.530 --> 00:23:59.520
that moved the hearts of the anti-entertainment faction.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.960
- Return to Lancastar-
